{
  "harness": "plan under conditions A, apply an update, recalculate, compare",
  "update": "event",
  "sampling": "an MMDA incident injected at a gazetteer intersection; origin and destination 1.5-5 km on opposite sides of it, kept only when the old route runs into it; risk unchanged",
